{"data":{"batches":["App: Safari. Window: Checkout – Example Shop. Page: https://shop.example.com/checkout.\nItems (number | kind | label | position | part of window | details):\n1 | toolbar | Toolbar | top\n2 | button | Back | top left | Toolbar\n3 | button | Forward | top left | Toolbar\n4 | text field | Address and search | top | Toolbar\n5 | button | Share | top right | Toolbar | tip: Send this page to someone\n6 | area | Keypad | left\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Explain the purpose, not just the name: what happens when someone uses it and why they would. Use what you know about Safari and common Mac and website conventions. For a link, say where it goes and why someone would go there. For a field, say what to type there. For a group, explain what its controls are for together and how to use them. For an area, say what that part of the window is for. Never just repeat the label.","App: Safari. Window: Checkout – Example Shop. Page: https://shop.example.com/checkout.\nItems (number | kind | label | position | part of window | details):\n1 | group of 10 buttons | 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 0 | left | Keypad\n2 | group of 4 buttons | +, −, ×, ÷ | center | Keypad\n3 | checkbox | Remember this card | center | on\n4 | pop-up menu | Currency | center | shows USD\n5 | button | Pay now | center\n6 | area | Sidebar | right\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Explain the purpose, not just the name: what happens when someone uses it and why they would. Use what you know about Safari and common Mac and website conventions. For a link, say where it goes and why someone would go there. For a field, say what to type there. For a group, explain what its controls are for together and how to use them. For an area, say what that part of the window is for. Never just repeat the label.","App: Safari. Window: Checkout – Example Shop. Page: https://shop.example.com/checkout.\nItems (number | kind | label | position | part of window | details):\n1 | group of 4 links | Pricing, Help, Blog, About us | top right | Sidebar\n2 | button | Reply | bottom left\n3 | link | Terms | bottom left | goes to /terms on this site\n4 | link | Contact | bottom right\nExplain every item above: one entry per item, in order, using the same numbers. Explain the purpose, not just the name: what happens when someone uses it and why they would. Use what you know about Safari and common Mac and website conventions. For a link, say where it goes and why someone would go there. For a field, say what to type there. For a group, explain what its controls are for together and how to use them. For an area, say what that part of the window is for. Never just repeat the label."],"cached":false,"prompt":"App: Safari. Window: Checkout – Example Shop. Page: https://shop.example.com/checkout.\nVisible items (number | kind | label | position | part of window | details):\n0 | button | Back | top left | Toolbar\n1 | button | Forward | top left | Toolbar\n2 | toolbar | Toolbar | top\n3 | text field | Address and search | top | Toolbar\n4 | button | Share | top right | Toolbar | tip: Send this page to someone\n5 | heading | Checkout | top left\n6 | icon | Example Shop logo | top right\n7 | visible text | Welcome to Example Shop | top left\n8 | link | Pricing | top right | Sidebar | goes to /pricing on this site\n9 | button | 1 | top left | Keypad\n10 | button | 2 | top left | Keypad\n11 | button | 3 | top left | Keypad\n12 | visible text | Enter the amount to pay | top left\n13 | button | + | top | Keypad\n14 | link | Help | top right | Sidebar | goes to help.example.com\n15 | button | 4 | left | Keypad\n16 | button | 5 | left | Keypad\n17 | button | 6 | left | Keypad\n18 | button | − | center | Keypad\n19 | checkbox | Remember this card | center | on\n20 | link | Blog | right | Sidebar | goes to /blog on this site\n21 | link | About us | right | Sidebar | goes to /about on this site\n22 | area | Sidebar | right\n23 | button | 7 | left | Keypad\n24 | button | 8 | left | Keypad\n25 | area | Keypad | left\n26 | button | 9 | left | Keypad\n27 | button | × | center | Keypad\n28 | pop-up menu | Currency | center | shows USD\n29 | button | 0 | left | Keypad\n30 | button | ÷ | center | Keypad\n31 | button | Pay now | center\n32 | text | All prices include tax. | center\n33 | button | Reply | bottom left\n34 | button | Reply | bottom\n35 | link | Terms | bottom left | goes to /terms on this site\n36 | link | Contact | bottom right\nWrite an overview of this page: what it is, what it is showing right now, and what someone can do here as a whole. Each button is explained separately afterwards.","request":"tour-1"},"ok":true}
